{
  "id": "27987_furiyamu",
  "headword": "{降|ふ}り{止|や}む",
  "reading": "ふりやむ",
  "romaji": "furiyamu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to stop raining; to stop falling (of rain or snow)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to stop raining; to stop (of rain or snow)",
      "explanation": "Of rain, snow, or hail, to cease falling. A compound of {降|ふ}る (to fall as precipitation) + {止|や}む (to stop)."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27987_furiyamu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{雨|あめ}→雨：00583_ame⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦やっと→やっと：01561_yatto⟧{降|ふ}り{止|や}んだ。",
      "english": "The rain has finally stopped.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27987_furiyamu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{雪|ゆき}→雪：00584_yuki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{降|ふ}り{止|や}む⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{待|ま}った→待つ：00469_matsu⟧。",
      "english": "I waited for the snow to stop falling.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27987_furiyamu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{夜中|よなか}→夜中：01008_yonaka⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{雨|あめ}→雨：00583_ame⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{降|ふ}り{止|や}んで、⟦{朝|あさ}→朝：02277_asa⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{青空|あおぞら}→青空：10084_aozora⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{広|ひろ}がっていた→広がる：01980_hirogaru⟧。",
      "english": "The rain stopped during the night, and by morning a blue sky had spread out.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Intransitive (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧). A compound of ⟦{降|ふ}る→降る：00839_furu⟧ + ⟦{止|や}む→止む：01153_yamu⟧, used only for precipitation (rain, snow, hail).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{雨|あめ}→雨：00583_ame⟧・⟦{雪|ゆき}→雪：00584_yuki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{降|ふ}り{止|や}む: the rain or snow stops\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {降|ふ}り{止|や}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = has stopped (and is still not falling) — a resulting state.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{止|や}む→止む：01153_yamu⟧: to stop (of rain, wind, sound) — {降|ふ}り{止|や}む specifies that something was falling\n- ⟦{晴|は}れる→晴れる：00701_hareru⟧: to clear up — focuses on the sky becoming clear, not just the rain ceasing",
